Package: ALprekDB
Type: Package
Title: Alabama Pre-K Administrative Data Processing and Database Management
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: person("JoonHo", "Lee",
                  email = "jlee296@ua.edu",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-4019-8703"))
Description: A modular toolkit for processing, cleaning, validating, linking,
    and managing Alabama First Class Pre-K (FCPK) administrative records. This
    package standardizes annual workflows for budget, classroom, and student
    data files received from ADECE (Alabama Department of Early Childhood
    Education). Features include data-driven column mapping via external
    codebooks, pattern-based format detection across file versions,
    reconciliation diagnostics, derived variable creation, multi-year panel
    construction, coverage-aware cross-module linkage, classroom-level student
    aggregation, DuckDB-based persistent storage with SQL query support,
    synthetic demonstration data, and privacy-conscious private workflow
    templates.
